<section class="section gbc-process" id="our-process">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">OUR PROCESS</div>
    <h2 id="gbc-process-title">FROM IDEA TO COMPLETION.</h2>
    <p class="gbc-process-intro">Design with us, bring your own designer, or come with your plans ready. We'll meet you where you are, with clear communication along the way.</p>
    <div class="gbc-process-steps">
      <article><b>01</b><h3>FREE CONSULTATION</h3><p>Tell us about your goals, project location, scope and timing. We'll discuss next steps and arrange a visit if needed.</p></article>
      <article class="optional"><span class="optional-label">AS NEEDED</span><b>02</b><h3>DESIGN &amp; SELECTIONS</h3><p>We'll plan your layout, build a 3D model and help you pick materials from our vendors. We can also work with your own designer, or you can skip ahead.</p></article>
      <article><b>03</b><h3>WRITTEN ESTIMATE</h3><p>We review the final scope, materials and scheduling, and prepare a written estimate for your consideration.</p></article>
      <article><b>04</b><h3>PERMITS &amp; PROJECT PREPARATION</h3><p>Where applicable, we coordinate required permitting, confirm project details and prepare the work area.</p></article>
      <article><b>05</b><h3>CONSTRUCTION &amp; PROGRESS UPDATES</h3><p>Our crew completes the work while our office coordinates scheduling and keeps communication moving.</p></article>
      <article><b>06</b><h3>FINAL WALKTHROUGH</h3><p>Review the completed work, discuss any outstanding items and wrap up the project.</p></article>
    </div>
    <div class="gbc-process-paths-heading">
      <h3>THREE WAYS TO START.</h3>
      <p>Every path ends with the same build team and the same walkthrough.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="gbc-process-paths">
      <article>
        <small>FULL DESIGN–BUILD</small>
        <h4>DESIGN WITH US</h4>
        <p>Starting from scratch? We guide layout, materials and selections, then build it — one team from first sketch to final walkthrough.</p>
        <div class="path-steps"><span>01</span><span>02</span><span>03</span><span>04</span><span>05</span><span>06</span></div>
      </article>
      <article>
        <small>COLLABORATIVE</small>
        <h4>BRING YOUR DESIGNER</h4>
        <p>Working with an interior designer or architect? We coordinate with them on plans and specs, then build to their vision.</p>
        <div class="path-steps"><span>01</span><span class="outline-step">02</span><span>03</span><span>04</span><span>05</span><span>06</span></div>
      </article>
      <article>
        <small>BUILD ONLY</small>
        <h4>PLANS READY</h4>
        <p>Designs and selections already decided? Skip the design phase and go straight from consultation to your written estimate.</p>
        <div class="path-steps"><span>01</span><span class="skip-step">02</span><span>03</span><span>04</span><span>05</span><span>06</span></div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

